n=`Set up automated document import from email accounts with smart filtering and routing. Configure sender whitelists, subject line rules, and attachment processing. Email ingestion eliminates manual forwarding and speeds up processing.`,p_n=`Customize email templates for notifications, alerts, and automated communications. Use variables to personalize messages with document data and user information. Professional templates improve communication and brand consistency.`,m_n=`Set up automated export of processed documents and extracted data to your ERP, accounting system, or archive. Configure export formats, mapping rules, and scheduling. Automated export ensures seamless data flow to downstream systems.`,h_n=`Configure groups, their users, and permissions for different document types. Control access levels and workflow capabilities for each user group. Use this to implement role-based access control across your organization.`,g_n=`Configure automated document import from email, FTP, cloud storage, and other sources. Set up import rules, file naming conventions, and processing triggers. Automated import eliminates manual upload and accelerates document processing.`,__n=`Connect DocBits with your ERP, CRM, and other business systems using API keys and webhooks. Seamless integration enables automated data exchange, reduces manual entry, and ensures real-time updates. Configure integrations to streamline your document workflows.`,v_n=`Define dropdown lists and validation values for document fields. Set up currency codes, payment terms, tax codes, and custom lookup lists. Controlled values improve data quality and user input efficiency.`,y_n=`Configure OCR engine settings, language packs, and image pre-processing options. Optimize recognition accuracy for different document formats and quality levels. Proper OCR configuration is critical for accurate data extraction.`,b_n=`Define user roles with specific permissions and capabilities for document processing workflows. Create role templates and assign them to user groups. Role-based access ensures security while maintaining operational efficiency.`,x_n=`Create and manage business rules for document validation, approval routing, and data processing. Set up conditional logic, tolerance ranges, and automated actions. Smart rules reduce manual intervention and improve accuracy.`,S_n=`Create and manage sub-organizations for departments, branches, or separate business units. Each sub-organization can have its own settings, users, and document workflows. This enables multi-tenant document processing within a single DocBits instance.`,C_n=`Manage user accounts, roles, and access permissions for your organization. Create new users, assign admin rights, and control who can access specific features and documents. Proper user management ensures security and maintains system integrity.`,w_n=`Title`,T_n=`Column name already exists`,E_n=`Column name already exists - Please activate it in Table Column settings`,D_n=`Title is mandatory`,O_n=`Title is required`,k_n=`To`,A_n=`To Date`,j_n=`Today`,M_n=` to design the layout`,N_n=`Toggled`,P_n=`API Key`,F_n=`Token Usage by Agent`,I_n=`Token consumption breakdown per agent`,L_n=`Tokens`,R_n=`tokens / month`,z_n=`Tolerance`,B_n=`Tolerance Amount`,V_n=`Differences up to this amount pass — absorbs rounding.`,H_n=`Tolerance value should be between 0 and 100.`,U_n=`Define acceptable variance thresholds for PO matching`,W_n=`Tolerance Type`,G_n=`To make this visible, change the field settings.`,K_n=`TOML-File`,q_n=`TOML mapping file is required`,J_n=`TOML Mapping File`,Y_n=`Per-agent override active — click to change`,X_n=`Tool Calls`,Z_n=`Requires approval in 'Critical' or 'All' mode`,Q_n=`Critical tools pause for human approval. Toggle a tool to override its default policy for this agent.`,$_n=`In this section, you can find various tools related to the document validation process.`,evn=`List of all used packages, the used version and the related licences`,tvn